Named the number of recruits from Ukraine preparing to be sent to the Don Basis
The official representative of the people’s Militia of the self-proclaimed Luhansk People’s Republic (LPR) Andriy Marochko said that in the winter of 2018-2019 Ukraine will send at least 3 thousand recruits to the Donbass.
According to him, in this way, Kiev plans “almost to somehow complete the units”.
“The reluctance of Ukrainian citizens to serve in the ranks of the armed forces of Ukraine, mass dismissals have led to the low manipulators of the units”, – said Marochko, quoted by “RIA Novosti”.
He also did not exclude the fact that the real figures of Ukrainians conscripted into the army can be increased if necessary.
In 2014-2017, Kiev began the so-called anti-terrorist operation (ATO), which was later replaced by a joint force (JFO) operation.
It was assumed that this measure will lead to an increase in the role of Ukrainian silovers in the settlement of the situation.
At the end of August 2018, the situation escalated in the Donbass due to the murder of DPR President Alexander Zakharchenko.
The DPR authorities qualified the incident as a terrorist attack.
In the course of an investigation of the criminal case were detained several people involved in the blast.
According to preliminary data, they confirmed that the sabotage was organized by Ukrainian special services.
The U.S. authorities forced Musk to leave the post of Chairman of the Board of Tesla
The American businesswoman Elon Musk will leave the position of the Chairman of the Board of Directors of the company he founded Tesla at the request of the U.S. authorities.
To regulate the claims of the Federal Securities and Exchange Commission, the entrepreneur will also pay $ 20 million.
According to CNBC, a pre-Trial agreement with the department allows Musk to remain at a directing position in Tesla.
In this case, it is obliged to pay $ 20 million and leave the position of Chairman of the Board of Directors within 45 days from the date of the agreement and at least for three years.
Two independent directors will be nominated.
It is specified that the agreement still has to be approved by the court.
On September 28 it became known that the Securities and Exchange Commission of the U.S. Securities and Stock Exchange accused Musk of misleading shareholders with a statement about the presence of sufficient funds to repurchase the shares of this company and filed a lawsuit against the businessman.
We are talking about the publication of the businessman on Twitter, where he announced his desire to repurchase Tesla shares of $ 420 apiece, but did not do it.
After the company's shares increased by almost 11%.
The head of the British foreign Ministry Compared the EU with the Soviet Union
The Minister of foreign Affairs of the United Kingdom Jeremy Hunt compared the European Union with the Soviet Union and accused Brussels of captivating the member countries of the community.
With such a statement, the diplomat made a statement at the ruling Conservative Battery in Birmingham, which opened on Sunday, September 30.
As noted by the Daily Mail, in this way Hunt commented on the difficulties in the negotiation process on Brexit.
What Happened to Behavior in the European Dream and Its Ideals?
The EU was created to protect its freedom, and the Soviet Union didn't let anyone leave.
The lesson of history is obvious: if you turn the EU from a community into a prison, the desire to leave it will not decrease, but will only grow, and we will not be the only incumbent who wants to escape from captivity,” the minister said.
He also added that the attempts to punish Britain for the decision to leave the European Union will only exacerbate the crisis, Gazeta
In mid-September, British Prime Minister Theresa May said that negotiations on Brexit had come to an impasse.
So she commented on the results of the informal summit of the European Union in Salzburg.
The decision on Brexit was adopted in 2016 following the results of the referendum.
It is expected that the exit of the United Kingdom should take place before April 2019, but negotiations with Brussels on this issue will complicate many factors.
In particular, there is still no clear agreement on how the parties will interact after London leaves the community.
In addition, it remains an open question about the Irish border.
Received mushroom mushes from the DPRK, the President of South Korea was presented with two dogs
The President of South Korea Moon Jae-in received two puppies as a gift from the leader of the North Korea Kim Jong-un after a visit to Pyongyang.
About it reports Reuters, with reference to the representative of the administration of the South Korean President.
“During the summit as a gift were offered a pair of pyongsan dogs.
On Thursday they were received”, – said the Agency.
For about a year, the Northkori side has donated several kilograms of fodder to dogs as “as assistance for their adaptation”.
The gamble was made in commemoration of an inter-Korean summit, which took place from September 18 to September 20 in Pyongyang.
Hunting breed pyongsan from North Korean wolves and received its name from one of DPRK counties.
As the agency notes, Moon loves the animals, he already has two such dogs, which was presented to him by the last leader of North Korea, Kim Jong Il.
Dogs aren’t the only gift.
Also, Kim Jong-un gave his colleague two tons of delicacic mushroom mushrooms Matsutake.
He decreed dissipating these mushrooms to members of families divided during the Korean war, which have not yet been reunited with their loved ones from the DPRK.
The head of the Altai village Council stopped the hunger strike in the protection of the interests of the residents
The Deputy said on his Facebook page that he stopped starving for several reasons.
The head of the village council said that the situation has reached an impenetrable stalemate, the district administration does not respond to his demands, and he needs to do his work.
In addition, the Prosecutor’s office began to test the situation, and the heat supply organization STKFR promised to begin work on the preparation of the system for the winter heating period of the village of Sibirsky next week.
Also, the residents of the village council compiled and removed the governor of the Altai Territory a mass collective appeal, "regarding the prevailing catastrophic situation."
Bohronin himself said that he feels normal, he was fulfilling his responsibilities of the head during the hunger strike in the course of a hunger strike.
As Boronin explained, the villages of Sibirsky and Rogular have centralized heat supply systems, which means that the administration of the Pervomaisky district should fulfill their authority to prepare them for the winter.
However, no one has yet begun these works.
The head of the village Council also protested against the lack of proper control and support from the government of the Altai Territory and against the financial policy of Gazprommezhregionegaz Novosibirsk.
In addition to the proper preparation of the settlements for the winter, Boronin demanded "immediately to organize a full-fledged independent utilities on the territory of the municipality with the corresponding staff units."
Named the new buildings of Moscow with the cheapest apartments
In the first six months of 2018, about three thousand units of housing with an area of 30 square meter and a cost of up to four million rubles were bought in new buildings of Moscow.
more than half of such transactions accounted for two residential utilities, according to the materials of the portal Urbanus (it is at the disposal of “Lenta.ru”).
The leaders in terms in terms of housing sales in the budget of up to four million rubles were GC "Nekrasovka", located for the Moscow Ring Order, in the Kotelniki area (SUVAO), and the Barbá's apartment complex "Barbaris" in the district of Bibirevo (SVAO).
Visible in the structure of transactions with budget housing there were also two residential utilities in New U.S. - Yuzhno Bunino and Maple alleys.
Analysts of Urbanus note that the share of transactions with apartments of up to four million rubles in these new buildings reaches 60 percent of all sales and provides half of the total revenue.
It is necessary to recognize the influence of apartments with a budget of less than four million rubles on the commercial success of the microdistrict “Central” in “Novy Vatutinkas” and “Filatov Lug”, – said in a study about two more LCD of New MUK.
Approximately 35 per per cent of their financial income is accounted for.
Earlier the rating of districts of Moscow with the cheapest apartments in new buildings was presented in the real estate agency “Bon Tone”.
According to the company, the lowest prices for primary dwelling (149.9 thousand rubles per meter) in September 2018 were recorded in South Africa.
In the second and third ranked were WAO and SVAO with indicators of 184.1 and 192.8 thousand rubles, respectively.
“Enji” in the minority beat “Zenith”, Markizio scored the first goal for the St. Petersburg club
The Italian distinguished himself in the 47-th minute of the match.
Footballers "Anzhi" won a strong-willed victory over "Zenith" in the 9-th round RPL.
the meeting was held in Kaspiysk and ended with a score of 2:1.
As part of the victories, Andres Ponce (71-th minute), as well as Vladislav Kulik, who scored in the th minute, realizing a penalty.
The only goal of the blue-and-and-white-blue on account of the 32-year-old midfielder Claudio Markizio (47), who scored the first goal for a new team.
It is worth noting that the hosts finished the match in the minority after the removal of Dmitry Belorukov at the 76-th minute.
Thus, despite the defeat in Kaspiysk, “Zenith” continues to occupy 1-st position in the RPL table.
The team has 22 points.
"Anzhi" - 9 points and the 12-th position.
Goals: Ponse, 71; Kulik, 83
"Anzhi": Dupin, Chancellor, Udaly, Belorukov, Savichev, Kukli, Rabiu (Glebov, 84), Gigolaev, Tchaikovsky, Ponse (Ondua, 80), Debt (Akhyadov, 69).
"Zenith": Lunev, Netu, Smolnikov, Ivanovich, Nabiullin (Zabolotny, 83), Yerokhin, Shatov (Kuzzyaev, 46), Paredes, Marquisio (Kokorin, 61), Driussi, Dzyub.
Warning: Savichev (5), Paredes (9), Tchaikovsky (59), Uda (60), Ponse (72), Smolnikov (82), Dupin (90+4).
Deletion: Belorukov, 76.
Judgment: Oleksiy Matyun.
Kaspiysk.
Anji-Arena.
Musk will leave the post of head of Tesla for a three-Yo-Year for closure of the criminal case
The American businessman Elon Musk concluded a pre-trial agreement with the Federal Securities and Exchange Commission, according to it, the businessman will leave the post of Chairman of the Board of Directors of Tesla within 45 days from the date of the agreement and at least for three years.
Also, he pledged to pay $20 million.
The agreement has yet to be approved by the court.
Users of the Telegram complained about the failure of a new version
iPhone users complained about the problems in the work of the Telegram messenger after the update, released on September 28.
The user's phone number can be recognized by its username
Complaints concern gadgets with the current operating system of iOS 12.
According to their owners, after the update, the application shows a white screen or immediately closes.
Representatives of the messenger reacted to the failure.
According to their words, the problem can be associated with migrating information to a new application written in Swift.
In Telegram temporarily suspended an automatic renewal of the application until troubleshuffles are eliminated.
On April 13, the Thagansk court of Moscow satisfied the claim of Roskomnadzor to block the Telegram messenger in Russia.
Three days later, the telecom operators began to implement the decision.
The reason was the refusal of the messenger administration to provide the FSB keys for deciphering the correspondence necessary to obtain data about the terrorists.
In August, Telegram changed the privacy policy and agreed to unleash the IP address and mobile phone number of a user suspected of terrorism when he received an relevant court decision.
The audience of Telegram after blocking in the Russian Federation was reduced by 1.2 million
I am happy for the guys who came out to implement a numerical advantage in the match with Dynamo Minsk
Bob Hartley: I am happy for the guys who came out to implement a numerical advantage in the match with Dynamo
The head coach of “Avant-garde” Bob Hartley summed up the match of the regular championship of the KHL against Dynamo Minsk (2:1).
It’s a very important victory for us.
After the match in St. Petersburg, we held a meeting and agreed that we have to leave behind this game and prepare for Minsk.
They knew that “Dynamo” had a good victory before our meeting, so they were prepared very seriously.
It was very important to throw in the majority, I am happy for the guys who came out to realize a numerical advantage.
We’ve played well in the majority lately, but we haven’t scored in any way.
Finally, the red light behind the gate was ignited.
We knew that Minsk will be loaded for the game, it will try, it turned out to happen.
The game in the majority was a decisive, the winning goal we scored in unequivourable teams.
We were able to spend a good third period today, despite the fact that we conceded an early goal in this period and it was understandable that it would not be easy in the future.
But we played very well in the defense, we did not give a lot of chances to the opponent, did not allow us to catch us on the shift, Dynamo did not have attacks with a numerical advantage, so it all turned out well for us.
The Ministry of Finance predicts a gradual easing ruble
The Ministry of Finance of Russia forecasts a gradual weakening of the ruble exchange rate against the U.S. dollar in perspective until 2035.
This is stated in the bill, which the Agency submitted to the state Duma, writes “Gazeta.ru”.
The department estimated that in 2021-20-25 one dollar will cost 66.4 rub., In 2026-2030 - 71.1 rubles, and in the next five years for a single dollar will ask for 73.9 rub.
“January called the disgraced collection of London duties on behalf of the EU after the Bread
The former Minister of foreign Affairs of the United Kingdom, Boris Johnson, called “absolutely obscure” the proposal of the government of Teresa May to collect British and the European Union duties for goods on behalf of each other after Brexit.
Johnson’s statement on the opening in Birmingham of an annual party congress of the ruling Thorium country was published by The Sunday Times.
In addition, the publication held an interview with Theresa May, who criticizes all the opponents of the current agreements with Brussels, believing that they are playing political games and undermining Britain's national interests.
On September 29 it became known that more than half of British citizens would vote against the country's withdrawal from the European Union (EU) in the second Brexit referendum.
"Anzhi" deserved good luck in the game with us
The head coach of the St. Petersburg “Zenith” Sergey Semak commented on the first defeat of his team this season.
In the ninth round of the championship of Russia on football blue-and-white-blue at a party lost to Makhachkala "Anji" with a score of 1:2.
There is no underestimation, there are two teams playing, and the same guys once again showed that you need to earn good luck.
Of course, good luck was on the side of "Anji" - both a penalty and a goal.
It is understandable that this was preceded by our gross mistakes”, – quotes the words Semak Championship.
Also, the head coach of “Zenith” noted that his players in the first half with the Makhachkala team acted very slowly, allowing the opponent to create a lot of scornal moments.
Recall that Makhachkala “Anji” at his home won “Zenith” with a score of 2:1, having the first defeat to the leader of the championship this season.
Driver Hamilton jokingly promised not to arrange Putin with a champagne
Driver of the team “Mercedes” Lewis Hamilton, who became the winner in the 16-th stage of the championship of “Formula 1” Grand Prix of Russia, jokingly promised not to arroke to the President of Russia Vladimir Putin a champagne shower, as in 2015.
“This time I won’t pour champagne for you, and at that time it was someone else,” Hamilton joked during a short conversation with the head of state.
Putin laughed in response and thagged the rider on the shoulder.
“Everything is fine,” said the Russian leader, commenting on the situation of three years ago.
Grand Prix of Russia “Formula 1” was held in “Sochi Avtodrom” from September 28 to September 30.
The second place was taken by the Finnish pilot “Mercedes” Valtteri Bottas.
The third became the German rider "Ferrari" Sebastian Vettel.
The Russian leader congratultimated Hamilton on the victory and presented him with an award.
According to tradition, “Formula 1” after the presentation of the awards, riders open Champagne.
October 11, 2015, Putin was also present at the solemn ceremony.
Hamilton, who, as well as this year, became the owner of the cup, opened the bottle and poured champagne against all those present, including the President of Russia.
RBC announced the imminent resignation of the governor of the Kurgan region
The Governor of the Kurgan region Alexei Kokorin will resign as part as part of a new rotation of the gubernatory hull, RBC reports with reference to two sources close to the presidential administration.
Officially about the decision will be announced in the near future, the newspaper notes.
One of the most important reasons for Mr. Kokorin’s departure is the fact that the region remained deppressive, with a low level of social and economic development.
Alexey Kokorin has not yet completed the first gubernatorial term, his powers will expire in 2019.
He was elected in September 2014, with a score of 84.8% of the vote.
Before the appointment of the acting governor in February 2014, Mr. Kokorin served as the head of Shadrinsk (Kurgan Oblast).
We will remind, on Wednesday, September 26, President Vladimir Putin spent a number of personnel appointments of the heads of the regions.
The acting Governor of Primorsky Krai instead of Andrei Tarasenko who participated in the gubernatory elections was appointed the head of Sakhalin Oleg Kozhemyako.
The acting head of the Astrakhan region was appointed deputy head of the Federal customs service Sergey Morozov.
