Makhachkala football club “Anji” in his field with a score of 2:1 beat the St. Petersburg “Zenith” in the match of the ninth round of the RPL.
As part of the blue-and-and-blue goal scored Claudio Marquisio (47 th minute).
Andères Ponce (71) and Vladislav Kulik (83).
“Zenith” is still the leader in the standings, his asset is now 22 points.
Makhachkala with nine points occupies 12-th place.
In the next round of the St. Petersburg team will host Krasnodar, and “Anji” on the road will play with Grozny “Ahmat”.
Elon Musk is obliged to leave the position of the head of the Board of Directors of Tesla
The U.S. Securities and Stock Exchange Commission and Tesla Founder Elon Musk have settled their dispute in the case of fraud.
This is reported by CNBC News.
According to the TV channel, as part of the agreements reached, Musk will have to leave the post of head of the Board of Directors of Tesla.
At the same time, the Commission allowed Musk to retain the position of the head of the Tesla.
As it is noted, the founder of Tesla will also have to pay an administrative fine in the amount of $ 20 million.
A similar amount will be recovered from Tesla.
At the same time the money will be distributed among the affected investors.
In addition, the company must arouse two independent directors.
Elon Musk - an American entrepreneur who is included in the list of the 50 richest people planet according to Forbes magazine.
He is the head of the space corporation SpaceX, the neurotechnological company Neuralink and the developer of electric cars Tesla, as a co-founder of Paypal.
U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission previously sue Tesla CEO Elon Musk because of his message, published on Twitter about the possible redemption of the company.
Last month, Musk announced plans to make Tesla a private company and repurchase all shares on the exchange at a fixed price of $ 420.
The cost of the $ $420 stock was set allegedly “due to the importance of this number in the culture of marijuana”, Bloomberg reported earlier, with reference to co-director of the security department Steven Pejkin.
At the same time, Elon Musk subsequently relinquished his plans to repurchase shares.
Commenting on a lawsuit lodged against him by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the businesswoman said that he considered the accusations of fraud unreasonable, and added that he is very frustrated and greased by these claims.
Honestness is the most important value in my life, and the facts will prove I didn’t break it in any way,” the businesswoman said in an interview with CNBC.
At the Same time in August, a group of shareholders of Tesla filed a collective lawsuit against Mask, complaining about the financial losses suffered.
The plaintiffs claimed that the positions of the businessman brought them losses.
In particular, one of the shareholders said that the businessman’s tweets were misleading, because of which Tesla stock sellers were forced to purchase securities at artificially inflated prices in order to cover their positions.
Other plaintiffs also noted that Negligible statements of Elon Musk led to sharp fluctuations in the course.
In September, Elona Musca accused the head of the research company Citron Research.
In the meantime, if Musk could not resolve his dispute with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, he would have been threatened with absolution from the management of the company and even a prison.
About it, in Particular, said the TV channel CNBC the former Chairman of the Commission Harvey Pitt.
Musk - "a good guy who does not know how to manage an automobile company."
“Real” in his field could not beat “Atletico”
The players of “Real Madrid” played a draw with “Atletico” in the home match of the 7-th round of the championship of Spain.
the meeting was held on the field of the stadium “Santiago Bernabeu” and ended with a score of 0:0.
After this game "Real" scored 14 points and occupies the second place in the standings examples, inferior to the leading in the championship "Barcelona" only in the goal difference.
"Atletico", having 12 points in the asset, is located in fourth place.
In the next round, “Real” on the out away will play with “Alaves”, and “Atletico” on his field will take “Betis”.
Valverde won the group race at the world Cup
The victor of the group race at the World Cycling Championship on the highway was the Spanish athlete Alejandro Walverde.
For the first time in his career, he has won such a victory.
38-year-old cycling rider finished the first of the group of leaders, overcoming 258 km of the mining route in the Austrian Innsbruck.
The second place went to the Frenchman Romen Barda, the third - Canadian Michael Woods.
In the ROC compared the possible renaming of the UOC with the actions of the f fascists
The Chairman of the Department of external ecclesiastical relations (OECS) of the Moscow Patriarchate, Metropolitan Hilarion of Volokolamsk, compared the possible renaming of the Ukrainian Orthodox Church into the Russian Church in Ukraine with the actions of the fascists in Germany.
Metropolitan Hilarion of Volokolam - about the causes of the conflict with the Patriarchate of Constantinople, a Possible ecclesiastical schism and its political connoisseur
According to him, now, when “the conflict between Russia and Ukraine is at an acute stage”, to rename the church is the same in f fascist Germany “the Jews to put a yellow six-nail star”.
“This means to label the church as an enemy organization, and it is for this purpose that this bill was created”, – said the representative of the RUSSIAN ROCE on the TV channel “Rossiya 24”.
The metropolitan also stressed that the UOC is not a Russian church, but a Ukrainian, since “the believers of this church consider themselves to be Ukrainian, they are patriots of their own country.”
The UOC urged the Konstantinopopol exarchs to leave its territory
Grand Prix in Sochi: a sold-out, the Russian car and the return of Kvyat
Over the next ten years in Russia may have its own racing car.
The Deputy Prime Minister Dmitry Kozak said this, summing up the meeting with Russian automakers on the eve of the Russian Grand Prix in Sochi.
Also, the Deputy Chairman of the government shared his opinion on the return of Daniil Kvyat to Toro Rosso and assessed the attendance of the Russian stage of “Formula 1”.
The result of our meeting with the automakers should in the foreseeable future just the creation of the Russian Formula 1 car, which has no analogues in the world, said Dmitry Kozak.
We need to stimulate our automakers in this direction.
We are talking about plans until 2024, but I don’t think it is possible in such a period.
I think it’s a more realistic deadline for the next ten years.”
From 2012 to 2014 in “Formula 1” under a Russian license was the team “Maries”.
According to the vice-premier, there are already investors who are ready to invest in the creation of a domestic team in the world championship on motor races in the Formula 1 class.
I know that in Russia there are fans of car sports, wealthy businessmen who are ready to invest, are ready to invest in the creation of the Russian team “Formula 1”, – he said.
"We are ready to support them morally.
Let's just hope that we will have such a team.
I suspect that the thoughts about the creation of the team appeared, among other things, because such an infrastructure has appeared in Sochi.
Tomorrow "Sochi Autodrome" expects a full house.
According to Dmitry Kozak, the organizer managed to sell all 50 thousand tickets.
Take a look, even in the qualifying tribunes were practically filled, the vice-premier said.
I can say that the revenue this year increased by 72% compared to last year.
It’s a good, positive result.
Also, we are preparing a plan of actions to increase the efficiency of the use of the infrastructure "Sochi Autodrom" throughout the year.
This will be an additional tourist product, which will attachl even greater attractiveness of Sochi.
Dmitry Kozak did not surpass the main topic of the day for Russian lovers of motorsport - the return of Daniil Kvyat to "Toro Rosso".
We all congratulate Daniil together and we wish him his success next season”, – said the Deputy Prime Minister of “Izvestia”.
He's a promising ridicoprous driver.
Next year for the first time in the history in the peloton “Formula 1” will be able to take the participation of two main Russian pilots at once.
Although the further fate of Sergei Sirotkin in “Royal races” is still unknown.
His contract with “Williams” ends at the end of the season, and the results are not yet impressed: he took 18-th place in the qualification of the Grand Prix of Russia.
Let's hope, next season there will be more of our main pilots than this year," Kozak said.
In Indonesia after an earthquake, more than 100 incinerators have escaped from prison
More than 100 inmates have escaped from a prison in the Indonesian province of Central Sulawesi.
Escape became possible after two powerful Earthquappances on an island of magnitude 7.2 and 7.4.
According to The Jakarta Post, the incident took place on September 28, when the prisoners in the prison of the city of Palu demanded them to be released in connection with tremors in connection with tremors.
More than 340 inmates rioted and set fire.
Accommoded at the place of the incident, the police partially took the situation under control, but more than 100 people escaped from a prison.
The building itself was severely damaged, and the security guards are able to withstand the prisoners.
The number of victims of an earthquake and tsun, which originated on the island of Sulawesi, has risen to 832 people.
In this regard, it has not yet been possible to establish transport, electricity and communication with certain areas of the island.
"Grolored Pearl" for "Listrual Realism"
The international film festival in San Sebastian for the for the third time in the history recognized a Spanish film.
The main award - "Golden Shell" - was awarded the drama "Meet two seas" directed by Isaki Lakuesta.
This film with almost documentary realism tells the difficult history of the life of the two brothers in the Spanish province of Cádice - Lacuesta presented a sequel to his 2006 film "The Legend of Time".
At the ceremony of awarding the awards of the film festival in San Sebastian honored the creators of the Argentine thriller "Red", which was marked in several nominations at once.
Benjamin Naschatta was declared the director of the year, Pedro Soterot was rewarded for camera work, and Dario Grandineti was recognized as the best actor.
The actress of the year at the film festival in San Sebastian was Pia Tielta from Norway.
The jury highly praised her participation in “Blind Spot” is a drama about the life of a single-family after the attempted suicide of her daughter.
The film became the directorial debut of the Swedish actress Tuva Novotny.
In the nomination “best script” the victory was shared by “Yuli” and “Loying Man”.
The special prize of the jury was received by the Filipino criminal drama “Alpha: The Right to Kill”.
Digging, Tears and Laughter
The festival in the San Sébastiana is called one of the main cultural events in Spain and one of the most important European film competitions.
About their impressions of the Euronews festival said the owner of the “Garden shell” Director Isaac Laquest:
It's been wonderful!
We came here the whole team and of course we experienced dividing dizzying moments, tears, laughter.
We're so happy.
This film we started preparing 14 years ago, it was a very long work, and what is especially important for me that we didn’t want to stop.
It’s time for joy and gratitude.
As the correspondnius correspondent Carlos Marlasca notes, the film Isaki Lakuesta organically fits into the collection of the paintings, which was received by “Golden Shells”, “but the festival in San Sebastian did not do without unexpected, sometimes shattering decisions of the jury, which are sometimes even referred to the calling card of the competition”.
Putin spent the day on vacation in the Khakasy taiga
The President of Russia Vladimir Vladimir Putin spent Saturday, resting in the taiga of Khakassia.
The press Secretary of the Russian leader Dmitry Peskov told reporters on Sunday, September 3.
In Khakassia, Putin stopped on the way from Dushanbe, where a summit of the leaders of the CIS countries took place on Friday.
“On the way from Du Dushanbe, Vladimir Putin made a stop in Khakassia, where he spent a Saturday’s taiga with a short vacation,” Peskov said.
He noted that the President went further to Sochi.
Appropriate on September 30 it became known that on Sunday Vladimir Putin visited the 16th stage of the championship of racing series “Formula 1”.
The President of Russia awarded the winner of the race Briton Lewis Hamilton, and also personally congratulified the rider during a brief conversation in the waiting area.
The Grand Prix of Russia was held at the Sochi racing track "Sochi Avtodor" from September 28 to September 3.
In August of this year Vladimir Putin on the way to the Far East made a two-day stop in the Tyva Republic in southern Siberia.
The Russian leader was fishing on mountainous lakes, walked on rivers on motorboats and rafts, and also made transitions along the mountains on quad bikes and on foot.
the President was accompanied by Defense Minister Sergei Shoigu, Viktor Zimin, who at that time served as head of Khakassia at that time, and the head of Tyva Sholban Kara-ool.
The head of state is not the for the first time visiting these territories
“Sochi” defeated “Chertanovo”, the teams for two scored eight goals
In the match of the 14-th round of the FNL "Sochi" on the road destroyed "Chertanovo" with a score of 6:2.
Among the winners of the meeting, a doppelganger was scored by Maksim Barbov (the 30th and 46th minutes) and Ivan Solovyov (40), Nikolay Obolsky (909) and Igor Gorbunov (90+1), another goal in his goal was scored by the defender of the hosts of the field Dmitry Redkovich (67).
As part of the Sochi team, Vladislav Sarveli (36) and Dmitry Tsypchenko (87) scored goals against the opponent.
It is worth noting that the owners of the field ended the meeting in the minority: a red card in the 77-th minute was received by Dmitry Redkovich.
In the asset of both teams for 20 points.
In the next round "Sochi" on October 6 will take "Luch", and “Chertanovo” on the same day on the road will play with “Avant-garde”.
Basta shamed Rostov fans
Russian musician Vasily Vakulenko, acting under the pseudonym Basta, appealed to the fans of the football club “Rostov” during his concert in the local arena.
His words are conveyed by Rostovgazeta.
So why are we so hypocritical and rejoicing only for success?
Where have you all been, when the club was in a terrifying position?
Everyone again remembered the great club, only when everything worked out.
