In the Kirov region there are four more mobile fluoroographers
At the expense of the federal budget, the region received four mobile fluoroographers.
Their cost is 64 million rubles.
They will be attributed to the district hospital of Slobodsky, Kotelnichsky, Vyatskolyansky and Soviet districts.
The complexes contribute to the early detection of Tuberculosis and other diseases of the thoracic system outside hospitals.
As the Governor of the Kirov region Igor Vasiliev said, these mobile fluoroographers belong to a new generation and are digital.
This will allow you to promptly transmit the information.
Previously in the region there were only analog mobile fluoroographers on the basis of KAMAZ.
It is planned that the new complexes will make it possible to increase the coverage of the population with fluorographic examination by 15 per cent.
Until now, 7 mobile fluorographers have been used in the Kirov region (2 - in Kirov, one - in the Vyatsky Polyan, Urzhom, Kirovo-Chepetsk, Omutninsk and Slobodsky).
