Barbra Streisand found her cloned dogs strangeness in behavior
American singer Barbra Streisand stated that the clones of her deceased dog behave quite differently than the original pet.
“They don’t look alike.
In fact, [clones] look like her, but it’s Impossible to clone your soul, ”the 76-year-old singer said.
At the end of 2017, Streizand ordered two clones of her 14-year-old Cotton-de-tulear dog named Samantha that had to be euthanized due to health problems.
In July 2018, it was reported that the dog of the chihuahua breed named Miracle Milly, who was called the smallest dog in the world, cloned for the 49th time.
