“In 2013 the transAtlantic integration of Ukraine, the accession to NATO was supported by 16% of Ukrainians.
Now this is more than 54%.
Who's done this?
Putin.
In the year of 2013 the European integration of Ukraine, the accession to the EU was supported by 33% of Ukrainians.
It’s now 74%.
Who's done this?
"Putin," Poroshenko said.
Therefore, thank you, Mr. P.Putin, for the fact that my country has become much more European and much more ready to defend European values and transatlantic values.
