Indonesia shrugged with aftershock after a powerful tsunami
In Indonesia, where several days ago there was an earthquake that provoked a three meter tsunami, meteorologists observe more than 170 aftershocks.
Magnitude was 7.4, mainly affected the island of Sulawesi, according to the TV channel “Rossoy 24”.
The death toll exceeded 420 people, and injuries received more than 500.
The authorities notified the population about tsunami threats in advance, but later it was canceled.
The fact is that the devices did not record the approach of the wave.
