Comedy “Evening school” was headed by an American box office
Comedy “Evening school”, which debuted in American cinemas last Friday, earned $ 28 million for its first weekend at the box office earned $ 28 million.
This result allowed an uncomplicated picture with Kevin Hart and Tiffany Haddish in the main roles to lead the box office of the United States for September 28-30.
