The head of the United States Donald trump said during a speech to supporters in the state of West Virginia about a noticeable improvement in relations with North Korea during his presidency.
Also, trump joked about their mutual indulgence with Kim Jong-un.
The American President noted that initially he and the leader of the D.Kordan took tough positions.
"Then we fell in love with each other.
The truth: he wrote me beautiful letters,” Trump jo said.
He called relations of Washington and Pyongyang at the moment “beautiful” and drew attention to the cessation of nuclear and missile tests in the DPRK.
Earlier, trump announced a new meeting with the leader of North Korea, Kim Jong-un.
According to him, the preparation is already carried out by Secretary of state Mike Pompeo.
Politicians’ first meeting took place in Singapore on June 12.
For the first time, Russia has defeated the EuroSkills point and medal standings
For the first time, the Russian national team defeated the European Professional Excellenency Championship for young people under the age of 25 in a scoring and medal standing, gaining the largest number of gold medals among 29 participating countries.
Russian contestants earned nine gold, eight silver, two Bronze medals and ten medallions for their professionalism.
The competition for 41 competencies was attended by 48 Russians from 17 regions of the country, writes RIA Novosti.
The General Director of the Union “Werldskills Russia” Robert Urazov said that gold medalists EuroSkills will receive 700 thousand rubles, for a silver medal - 350 thousand rubles, 250 thousand rubles - for a bronze one.
In addition, 200 thousand rubles will be received by the participants for a medallion for professionalism.
According to the number of medals, Russia was ahead of Austria and France, in a scoringal standing - Austria and Hungary.
In total, 600 contestants took part in the championship.
The sixth championship took place in Budapest from September 25 to September 29.
In Macedonia will hold a referendum on the renaissance of the country
Referendum on the agreement with Greece on the renaming of the Republic of Macedonia will be held on September 30, TASS reports.
Citizens will be offered to answer the question of whether they are advocivating state membership in the European Union and NATO, taking into account the treaty with Greece.
At the same time, the results of the vote will not be legally binding, but will be advisory in nature.
Polacies will begin to work in the country from 7 o'clock in the morning local time.
According to the laws of the country, more than half of the voters should take part in the referendum in order to be recognized as successful.
