"What have you been waiting for?
It's Russia!
Around blunt and nepotism.
And the money in the family budget will not be superfluous!
“Phase of the Absurdity Continues!”
users also remembered that in one of the seasons of the traditional “Voice” at the blind auditions was the son of Gradsky.
Then the meter did not come to the first thing it came to come to take my son into his own team.
Moreover, he said: "Come on, get out of here, everything is understandable."
