The military of Canada was allowed to wear beards to increase the spirit
The Ministry of defence of Canada issued an order, which allows servicemen to wear beards.
According to the CBC TV channel, the bill contains instructions for the care of the beard.
It is noted that the military may be ordered to shave “for security considerations”.
The beard of the military can not be longer than 2 cm, it must also be carefully trimmed, and the Neeksi and cheetical cheekbones should be shaved.
At the same time, employees of the navy was allowed to wear a beard only on land.
It is expected that the innovist “will increase the morale in the army and will attract more Canadians to the service.”
The ban of wearing a beard has acted in the Canadian army since World War II.
Earlier it was reported that the cops in France were also allowed to wear beards and even to have tattoos.
At the same time, the court in Egypt supported the decision to dismantle from the service of police officers who carry beards.
The Ministry of internal Affairs of Ukraine will strengthen its presence in the Sea of Azov
The Ministry of internal Affairs of Ukraine will increase the number of its subdivisions in the waters of the Azov sea "to ensure the inviolability of the state border."
“We are strengthening the work of the units of the interior Ministry in this area and are creating a unified security monitoring system, which will consist of border guards, national guards and the police.
In the future, it will be reinforced by aviation units”, – quotes the Minister of internal Affairs of the country Arsen Avakov the press service of the Ministry of internal Affairs of the Ministry of internal Affairs.
Subsequently, the authorities of Ukraine announced the intention to create a naval base on the Azov by the end of 2018 in response to “aggressive actions of Russia in the region”.
It was reported that two artillery armored personnel carriers of the Ukrainian Navy have already been launched in Berdyansk.
“Torpedo” won the fourth victory in a row, beating “Amur”
In the match of the KHL regular season "Torpedo" on home ice beat "Amur" - 4:3.
Among the winners of the meeting, a double was issued by Andy Mili (11th and 45 minutes) and Dmitry Rodionychev (46) and Vladimir Galuzin (47) scored Tomas Filippini (13), Vladislav Ushani (17) and Pavel Dedunov (24).
"Torpedo" won the fourth victory in a row in a row and occupies the third place in the Eastern conference, and "Amur" in it is located on the 12th line, having seven points in the asset.
In the next emplacement David Nemirovski entries on the road will play against Lokomotiv on October 4, and Nikolai Borshchevsky will host Avtomobilist the next day.
Rodionov presented Bocchetti memorable T-shirt for 100 games in Spartak
The General Director of “Spartak” Sergey Rodionov before the match with “Rostov” was congratulated by the defender Salvatore Bockettti, who overcame the mark of 100 matches for the club in the meeting of the last round with CSKA (1:1).
Rodionov presented Bocchetti a commemorative sign in the shirt "Spartacus" with a game number 100 for the corresponding number of games.
We will remind, the 31-year-old defender moved to the Moscow club from “Rubin” in the summer of 2013.
In Russia will begin to be penalized for violations in the field of shared construction
From tomorrow in Russia will begin to be fined for violations in the field of shared construction, the Rossiya 24 channel reports.
The punishment threatens companies and officials, if they do not transfer data on the built house in the Unified information system of housing construction in time.
The innovation will help for those who decided to buy an apartment in a new building, but is afraid of the bankruptcy of the developer.
This was discussed at a conference in St. Petersburg for representatives of the construction industry.
Because of the amendments to the law on shared construction, developers will have to fully lend in the bank.
And many experts have already begun to talk about a possible large increase in the price of apartments.
But as it turned out, not everyone agrees with this.
In the center of Kiev the robber threatening the man with a knack, forcing him to withdraw money from an ATM.
The incident occurred in the evening of September 29 on the street of Ivan Kudri, said the capital’s law enforcement officers.
According to the victim, an unknown person approached him and opened a conversation, but then suddenly snatched a knife and demanded to give him money and a mobile phone.
Since the Victim did not have cash, the stranger ordered to withdraw the money from a bank card.
after the attacker received 4 thousand hryvnia and a phone, he hit the victim and fled”, – stated in the message.
Law enforcement officers managed to decapitate the robber, they turned into a 25-year-largest resident of Kiev.
Now he faces up to seven years in prison.
Also, the cops are working out the version about the involvement of the attacker in other similar crimes.
We will remind, on the eve in Odessa there were several resonant robberies of collectors.
In one of the cases, armed robbers were caught using a drone.
The scientist told about the possible scientific program of the expedition of the Russian Federation to the moon
The head of the Institute for Space Research of the Russian Academy of Sciences, Corresponding Member of the Russian Academy of Sciences Anatoly Petrukovich told RIA Novosti about a possible program of scientific research for Russian cosmonauts on the Moon.
According to him, now the scientific community is engaged in the development of areas of such work.
“Consolidated opinion does not yet exist”, – said the scientist.
He noted that one of the options is to place a low-frequency radiotelescope on the reverse side of the moon, which would avoid interference, the source of which is the Earth.
“This is the only place where such a telescope can be deployed to study cosmic sources of radio emission,” Petrukovich said.
He also believes that the moon could be used to carry out robotics tests, use local resources for construction.
In addition, the cosmonauts should be involved in the search for primitive organic on the Earth satellite, the scientist believes.
This could help to determine how life appears on the planets.
Earlier, the head of Roscosmos Corporation said that in the optimistic version of the Russian Federation can carry out a manipulative flight to the moon by 2030.
The offended client knocked the cart with feces in a 7-Eleven store
Damian Simms, a 41-year-old resident of St. Petersburg (Fóloride), as they say, "had a tooth" on a round-the-cretoky grocery store manager of the 7-Eleven network store: in May he put him out of the store for inappropriate behavior.
And decided to avenge his enemy in an original way.
In the middle of the second at night, he went to the store and poured on the floor and on a part of the goods located on the shelves the contents brought with him carcin.
In the basket there were feces and urinary, which Simms “borrowed” from the nearby mobile toilet.
Arrived at the scene of the police arrested the “avenger”.
He was placed in a pub in Jaurier and was bail of $300.
He was charged with an illegal intrusion of someone else’s property and in a criminal offense, and it is also forbidden to enter the store and get closer to the manager.
Although Simms' crime looks rather ridiculous than a serious, a court verdict can be quite severe, since it has repeatedly violated the law before: there are large-scale the theft, a robbery, illegal possession of a weapon, driving a car in a drunken state and ill-treasurance of animals.
In the United States called the most formidable submarine of Russia
The most imaginary enemy submarine for the U.S. Navy will be the Russian submarine "Kazan" of the project "Yasen-M", writes The National Interest.
The submarine was launched in March 2017, but the navy will be put into service in 2019.
According to the publication, even the precursor of “Kazan” submarine “Severodvinsk” was praised by the American military.
We will encounter a severe potential adversary.
It's only enough to take a look at "Severodvinska," Re-Admiral Dave Johnson was quoted.
At the same time, the publication writes that the United States maintains an advantage in this industry over Russia.
Multipurpose nuclear submarines "Kazan", "Novosibirsk", "Krasnoyarsk" and "Arkhangelsk" are being built according to an improved Yasen-M project (885M).
They compromise are 13 800 tons, immersion depth - 520 m, crew - 64 people, autonomy - 100 days, an underwater speed - 31 nodes.
In armed the submarines are mines, torpedoes 533 mm, cruise missiles "Onyx" and "Calibra".
In August, U.S. Navy’s press service said that U.S. undercarriages remain “the most potentious and frightening on the planet.”
German Politicians Ignored the Discovery of the Mosque Because of Erdoğan
The prime minister of North Rhine-Vestphalia, Armin Lashet, and emborto-burgromes of Cologne Henrietta Recker ignored the opening ceremonies of a new city Mosque.
This is reported by Deutsche Welle.
The event was attended by Turkish President Recep Tayyyip Erdoğan.
Lachet met with Erdoğan at Cologne airport, but refused to go to the mosque, explaining that the event could turn into an “extremely politicized event”.
Recker said that she received an unavailable invitation on the eve of the opening, on Friday, September.
According to its press Secretary, such a proposal should be considered as belated and frivolous.
Speaking in the square in front of the mosque, Erdoğan summed up a two-day visit to Germany.
The President called them successful, according to him, he was able to meet with the President of Germany Frank-Walter Steinmeier and Chancellor Angela Machary, with whom he discussed, among other things, the fight against racism and Islamophobia.
The new mosque in Cologne has become one of the largest in Europe, it is able to simultaneously accommodate about 1.1 thousand believers.
The construction cost 30 million euros, funding was provided by the Turkish side.
In Ivanovo it will be possible to become a diver, speleologist or climber
Occupations in these specialties will be conducted by the youth club "Ressaver", located in the regional center.
However, these three interesting professions are not limited to the activities of the club - listeners of numerous courses and seminars will also be able to learn sailing, catalysis medicine, undergo parachute training and receive initial knowledge in psychology.
Moreover, listeners receive knowledge not only theoretically - in the program of the club there are also practical fees.
You can find out for more detail in IGHTU on October 8 (Mon-Monday) at 19:30 in auditorium 201 (hustle B) and in IGEU on October 10 (environment) at 19:30 in auditorium B-516.
All classes are free of charge.
