Became known the names of laureates of the Fazil Iskander Prize
We are presented with awards to the winners of the Facsil Eskander Prize.
The award ceremony took place in the Central House of Writers in Moscow.
In the nomination “Prose” the laureate was Kant Ibrahimov, the novel “Stegal”.
The romance "Stegal" begins as the diary of an oncological patient and turns to the end into an epic work.
In the nomination "Poetry" - Vyacheslav Shapovalov, a book of germs "Eurosis".
"The Best Script Movie Scientist" - the work of Sergei Dmitrenko based on the stories told by Fasil Iskander in the book "Sandro from Chegem".
In the nomination "Chegham Heights" - Auren Khabechev, a series of stories "My Great Nothing".
In addition to the main competition, special diplomas were presented to Elena Nesterina for the notion of "Eternal Happiness!" and Lyudmila Vyazmitinova for a book of germs "Mondays", TASS reports.
Fasil Iskander (1929 - 2016) was born in Sukhum.
He graduated from the Literary Institute in 1954.
The first poetry collections - "Mining Troses" (1957), "Beauty of the earth" (1959), "Green Rain" (1960) - were recognized by critics and readers.
His real notoriety brought him the notoriety “Constellaration Kozlotour” (1966).
Iskander's best-known novel is Sandro from Chegem.
The British pilot “Mercedes” Lewis Hamilton became the winner of the Russian Grand Prix of the world championship of Formula 1.
He came the first to the finish line in Sochi by the decision of the team, which gave an instruction to his partner Valtéri Bottas to miss the rider forward.
Hamilton himself after the race said that he is not proud of this victory.
Bottas, which was the best in qualifying, eventually came second.
After the pilots of “Mercedes” finished Sebastian Vettel and Kimmi Raikkonen from “Ferrary”.
In the overall standing-and-off, pilots Hamilton and Vettel remain in the first and second positions, they are separated by more than 50 points.
Bottas, thanks to the victory in Sochi rose to the third line, squeezing Raikkonen.
In the cup of constructors is also led by "Mercedes", "Ferrary" in second place, closes to the top three teams "Red Bull".
The next stage of Formula 1 will take place in Japan.
The race will take place on the highway in Suzuka on October 7.
The SBU established an identity and detained the owner of the Peugeot-301, who on the eve traveled through the capital with license plates of the so-called “DPR”.
It turned out to be a former employee of the Ministry of internal Affairs of Ukraine, who currently works as an agent of one of the insurance companies of Ukraine.
According to the press center of the SBU, the detainee explained that the specified car since 2014 was wanted by Interpol, in connection with which he was detained on the territory of the territory of Russia and was transferred to him as a representative of an insurance company.
When crossing the Ukrainian-Russian border, he withdrew fake license plates, but at the entrance to Kiev again installed them.
According to him, he did this "to ensure the compliance of the registration license numbers of a package of documents for the specified car, issued by Russian representatives of Interpol, in the event of a stop of the vehicle to be checked by police officers of Ukraine."
“Currently, a set of measures is being carried out to verify the provided explanations, as well as to establish its possible involvement in terrorist activities,” the SBU said.
It should not be noted that in Ukraine the use of numbers issued by the terrorists in the territories of Donbas seized by them is prohibited.
By the way, earlier an employee of the State border service was showered for a car with such numbers in Mariupol.
The Ministry of Finance predicts a depreciation of the rate of up to $73.9 / dollar by 2031-2035
The Ministry of Finance of Russia forecasts a gradual easing ruble exchange rate of the ruble to 73.9 rubles per US dollar in the period until 2036.
The agency also predicts the stabilization of world oil prices in the range of $ 40-50 per barrel in this period.
This is stated in the “budget forecast of the Russian Federation until 2036” on the portal of the budget system.
According to the prognator of the Ministry of Finance of the th of the th of the Russian Federation, the ruble exchange rate in the U.S. Dollar in the period 2021-2025 will amount to 66.4 rubles/dollar in 2031-2035 - 73.9 rub./Dollar.
In addition, according to the assessment of the Russian Ministry, with a high probability the prices of oil on the average and long-term horizon will stably stabilize in the range of $ 40-45 per barrel in constant prices.
Urals crude oil, sometimes forecasts of the Ministry of the Ministry of Finance, will cost in the period of 2021-2025 - $ 55.2 per barrel, in 2026-2030 - $52.2 per barrel, and in the period 2031-2035 - $54.9 per barrel.
In the United States announced a possible naval blockade of Russia
If necessary, the United United States can impose a naval blockade of Russia in order to thwart its energy supplies to the countries of the Middle East.
This was stated by U.S. Interior Minister Raican zinke.
Speech at an industrial event in Pittsburgh, the head of department said that for the Russian economy, the only source of income is the sale of energy and Moscow conducts an active policy in the Middle East to sell oil and gas there, as it is doing in Europe.
Zinke also noted that a similar situation is with Iran.
To resolve it, according to the Minister, there are two options for the development of events: the military and the economic.
He would prefer not to use, so it is necessary to put pressure and squeeze the Iranian energy resources.
The Russian missiles will hold exercises on the coast of the Baltic sea
Soldiers of the missile connection of the Baltic fleet will conduct exercises on the shores of the Baltic sea.
On September 30, Interfax reports this with reference to Roman Martov, head of the information support department of the Western Military District in Balt Fleet.
Strikes on the ships of the conditional enemy will be inflicted using coastal missile systems, designed to combat surface ships and protect the maritime coast of the Kaliningrad region.
“On the positions, the rocket launchers will receive targeted instructions and will carry out electronic launches from missile systems “Bal” and “Bastion” on the detachment of ships of a conditional enemy”, – said Martov said.
Also, as part of the exercises, the military will check the operability of the missile systems and carry out measures for loading and unleeping weapons of missile systems.
In August, the nuclear submarine "Orel" of project 949A took part in the exercises of the Russian Naval Naval Naval in the Baltic Sea.
Then the elements of the anti-sabotage, mine, air, anti-submarine and anti-correcival defense were worked out.
The navy of Ukraine has completed the exercises in the Sea of Azov
The Naval (Navy service) of Ukraine has completed command-staff exercises “Kazatskaya will – 2018” in the Sea of Azov, told on September 30 in the press-center of the country’s navy.
“The main purpose of the exercises is to increase the capabilities of the structure of the military control in the course of conducting defensive actions by the troops, the planning and implementation of a counter-attacking operation”, – stated in the message.
The military was involved in the exercises of the batter and the ships.
Tactical groups on the boats carried out live filaments, isolated a section of the sea coast and defended maritime communications, reports TASS.
In the meantime, the naval group practiced mine-restriction scenarios.
According to the Deputy head of the Ukrainian nas Ministry for combat training of Re-Admiral Re-Ad-Admiral Aleksey Neizhpap, one of the main elements of the exercises in the first place is the interaction with the air forces and amphibious assault troops.
On September 29, the interior Minister of Ukraine Arsen Avakov said that the Agency has enlarged the number of its subdivisions in the Aquarius of the Azov Sea.
Rostov citizen took the third place at the international tournament in Greco-Roman wrestling
On September 29, final fights took place in Serbian Belgrade.
32-year-old Alexander Chekhirkin from Rostov performed in the weight category up to 77 kilogram.
In the wreck for the third, he met Finnish wrestler Tero Halmesmaki.
The athlete from the Donetsk capital confidently defeated his opponent with a score of 3:1, having conquered the breeze of the tournament.
It should not be noted, the Russian national team has won 14 medals at competitions: nine gold, four silver and one breeze.
Alexander Chekhirkin - three-time champion of Russia in Greco-Roman wrestling.
In addition, three times he won silver at the all-Russian competition and three times - bronze.
