with the help of the operation in Syria, Russia has shielded itself from the terrorists
For the next three years of the Russian military operation in Syria, about 100 thousand terrorists were killed, of which 85 thousand terrorists were destroyed by the Aerial and space forces of the Russian Federation.
This was stated in connection with the third anniversary of the beginning of the Russian military operation in Syria the former commander-in-chief of the VKS, the head of the Federation Council Committee on defense and security Viktor Bondarev.
He noted the high accuracy of using means of destruction from the air: the Aerospace forces carried out and continue to carry out all strikes exactly at the objects of the terrorists.
According to Bondarev, in three years in Syria destroyed tens of thousands of terrorist facilities - we are talking, for example, about ammunition depots, fortified areas and headquarters.
With the help of Russian airstrakh airstrikes, jihadists was hacked - this became a decisive contribution to the promotion of Syrian government troops, Interfax reports.
At the same time, according to Bondarev, the operation of our military in Syria made it possible to fence Russia itself from the terrorists, many of whom had Russian passports.
At the beginning of the operation in Syria, more than two-three territory of the Arab Republic were under the control of terrorist groups, including the Islamic State (IG, banned in Russia) and Jabhat al-Nusra (prohibited in Russia).
According to the General staff of the armed forces of the Russian Federation, about four thousand militants from among Russian citizens and about five thousand citizens of the post-Soviet countries were on the Side of ISIS, reports TASS.
And we are talking only about fixed persons, not counting those who have not been identified, said Bondarev.
Most of them were trained and ready at any time to take weapons in their hands, and Russian passports gave them the right to freely enter the territory of our country.
Thus, Bondarev noted, in Syria Russia is fighting international terrestrial terrestrial terrorism on its distant borders - otherwise this is an said "would pour towards us."
